  "description": "Bridges Umbraco 17 content Dictionary items into the backoffice UI localization system. After install, any `#Key` in a content-type property label (or anywhere `localize.string()` is called) resolves to the current backoffice user's culture value from the Dictionary section. Works for every existing and future dictionary key; no per-key manifest wiring.",
